{% comment %}
  ============================================================
  myrootalia — PAGE PRODUIT COMPLÈTE (Liquid personnalisé)
  ============================================================
  ▸ À coller dans une section « Liquid personnalisé » placée
    sur le TEMPLATE PRODUIT (l'objet `product` doit exister).
  ▸ Synchronisation panier native :
      - ajoute via /cart/add.js (AJAX, sans rechargement)
      - met à jour le tiroir panier du thème + la bulle du
        panier dans le header, et ouvre le tiroir
      - repli automatique : bulle + toast si pas de tiroir
  ▸ 100 % autonome : HTML + CSS + JS scopés (préfixe mrt-),
    aucune dépendance, aucune collision avec le thème.

  Réglages rapides ↓
{% endcomment %}

{%- assign mrt_show_avis = false -%}   {%- comment -%} true quand tu as de VRAIS avis (jamais de faux avis) {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mrt_sticky = true -%}       {%- comment -%} false si la barre d'achat sticky du thème est déjà active {%- endcomment -%}

{%- if product == blank -%}
  <p style="text-align:center;padding:40px 20px;">⚠️ Place cette section sur un template <strong>produit</strong>.</p>
{%- else -%}

{%- assign v0 = product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
{%- assign uid = section.id | slice: 0, 8 -%}

<div class="mrt-pp" id="mrt-pp-{{ uid }}">

  {%- comment -%} ========== STYLES (scopés .mrt-pp) ========== {%- endcomment -%}
  <style>
    #mrt-pp-{{ uid }}{
      --mrt-forest:#1E3A2F; --mrt-forest-deep:#152A21; --mrt-gold:#C6A15B;
      --mrt-cream:#FAF6EF;  --mrt-sand:#F1EAE0;        --mrt-ink:#25332C;
      --mrt-muted:#6E7C74;  --mrt-line:rgba(30,58,47,.12);
      --mrt-r:18px; --mrt-r-sm:12px;
      --mrt-serif:var(--font-heading-family, 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif);
      --mrt-sans:var(--font-body-family, 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif);
      font-family:var(--mrt-sans); color:var(--mrt-ink);
      background:var(--mrt-cream); line-height:1.6;
      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    }
    .mrt-pp *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
    .mrt-pp img{max-width:100%;display:block}
    .mrt-wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}
    .mrt-sec{padding:64px 0}
    @media(max-width:749px){.mrt-sec{padding:40px 0}}
    .mrt-alt{background:var(--mrt-sand)}
    .mrt-dark{background:var(--mrt-forest);color:var(--mrt-cream)}
    .mrt-kicker{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.22em;
      text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mrt-gold);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:12px}
    .mrt-h2{font-family:var(--mrt-serif);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(26px,4vw,38px);
      line-height:1.2;text-align:center;margin-bottom:14px}
    .mrt-sub{text-align:center;color:var(--mrt-muted);max-width:560px;margin:0 auto 40px}
    .mrt-dark .mrt-sub{color:rgba(250,246,239,.72)}

    /* boutons */
    .mrt-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;
      width:100%;padding:17px 32px;border:0;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;
      background:var(--mrt-forest);color:var(--mrt-cream);font-family:var(--mrt-sans);
      font-size:16px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.02em;text-decoration:none;
      transition:transform .25s ease, box-shadow .25s ease, background .25s ease}
    .mrt-btn:hover{background:var(--mrt-forest-deep);transform:translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow:0 12px 28px -12px rgba(21,42,33,.55)}
    .mrt-btn[disabled]{opacity:.5;pointer-events:none}
    .mrt-btn .mrt-spin{display:none;width:18px;height:18px;border:2px solid rgba(250,246,239,.35);
      border-top-color:var(--mrt-cream);border-radius:50%;animation:mrtspin .7s linear infinite}
    .mrt-btn.is-loading .mrt-spin{display:inline-block}
    .mrt-btn.is-loading .mrt-btn-label{opacity:.65}
    @keyframes mrtspin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}

    /* ---------- HERO ACHAT ---------- */
    .mrt-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:56px;align-items:start;padding:48px 0 56px}
    @media(max-width:899px){.mrt-hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px;padding:24px 0 40px}}
    .mrt-gallery{position:sticky;top:24px}
    @media(max-width:899px){.mrt-gallery{position:static}}
    .mrt-main-img{border-radius:var(--mrt-r);overflow:hidden;background:var(--mrt-sand);
      aspect-ratio:1/1;box-shadow:0 24px 60px -30px rgba(21,42,33,.35)}
    .mrt-main-img img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:opacity .3s ease}
    .mrt-thumbs{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px;overflow-x:auto;padding-bottom:4px}
    .mrt-thumb{flex:0 0 72px;height:72px;border-radius:var(--mrt-r-sm);overflow:hidden;
      cursor:pointer;border:2px solid transparent;opacity:.7;transition:.25s;background:var(--mrt-sand)}
    .mrt-thumb img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
    .mrt-thumb.is-active{border-color:var(--mrt-gold);opacity:1}
    .mrt-thumb:hover{opacity:1}

    .mrt-buy .mrt-brand{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;
      color:var(--mrt-gold);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px}
    .mrt-title{font-family:var(--mrt-serif);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,40px);line-height:1.15;margin-bottom:10px}
    .mrt-pitch{color:var(--mrt-muted);font-size:16.5px;margin-bottom:18px}
    .mrt-pitch strong{color:var(--mrt-ink)}
    .mrt-price-row{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:22px}
    .mrt-price{font-family:var(--mrt-serif);font-size:30px;color:var(--mrt-forest)}
    .mrt-compare{color:var(--mrt-muted);text-decoration:line-through;font-size:17px}
    .mrt-save{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--mrt-forest);background:rgba(198,161,91,.22);
      border-radius:999px;padding:5px 12px;letter-spacing:.03em}

    .mrt-opt-label{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:9px;color:var(--mrt-muted)}
    .mrt-opts{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin-bottom:20px}
    .mrt-opt{padding:10px 18px;border-radius:999px;border:1.5px solid var(--mrt-line);
      background:#fff;cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;font-family:var(--mrt-sans);transition:.2s}
    .mrt-opt.is-active{background:var(--mrt-forest);border-color:var(--mrt-forest);color:var(--mrt-cream)}
    .mrt-opt:not(.is-active):hover{border-color:var(--mrt-forest)}

    .mrt-buyrow{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:14px}
    .mrt-qty{display:flex;align-items:center;border:1.5px solid var(--mrt-line);
      border-radius:999px;background:#fff;flex:0 0 auto}
    .mrt-qty button{width:42px;height:52px;border:0;background:none;font-size:19px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--mrt-ink)}
    .mrt-qty input{width:38px;height:52px;border:0;text-align:center;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;background:none;-moz-appearance:textfield}
    .mrt-qty input::-webkit-outer-spin-button,.mrt-qty input::-webkit-inner-spin-button{-webkit-appearance:none}
    .mrt-error{display:none;color:#A4442E;font-size:14px;margin:-4px 0 12px}
    .mrt-error.is-visible{display:block}

    .mrt-reassure{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 18px;margin:6px 0 20px;
      font-size:13.5px;color:var(--mrt-muted)}
    .mrt-reassure span::before{content:"✓";color:var(--mrt-gold);font-weight:700;margin-right:7px}
    .mrt-delivery{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--mrt-line);
      border-radius:var(--mrt-r-sm);padding:13px 16px;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:22px}
    .mrt-delivery b{color:var(--mrt-forest)}

    .mrt-acc{border-top:1px solid var(--mrt-line)}
    .mrt-acc details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--mrt-line)}
    .mrt-acc summary{list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
      padding:17px 2px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;font-size:15.5px}
    .mrt-acc summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
    .mrt-acc summary::after{content:"+";font-size:21px;font-weight:400;color:var(--mrt-gold);transition:transform .3s}
    .mrt-acc details[open] summary::after{transform:rotate(45deg)}
    .mrt-acc-body{padding:0 2px 18px;color:var(--mrt-muted);font-size:14.5px}
    .mrt-acc-body ul{padding-left:18px;display:grid;gap:6px}
    .mrt-acc-body strong{color:var(--mrt-ink)}

    /* ---------- bandeau défilant ---------- */
    .mrt-marquee{overflow:hidden;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,246,239,.12);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(250,246,239,.12)}
    .mrt-marquee-track{display:flex;gap:48px;width:max-content;animation:mrtmarq 28s linear infinite;
      font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap}
    .mrt-marquee-track span::after{content:"✦";margin-left:48px;color:var(--mrt-gold)}
    @keyframes mrtmarq{to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}
    @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.mrt-marquee-track{animation:none;flex-wrap:wrap;width:auto;justify-content:center}}

    /* ---------- cartes ---------- */
    .mrt-grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}
    .mrt-grid4{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px}
    @media(max-width:899px){.mrt-grid3,.mrt-grid4{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
    @media(max-width:559px){.mrt-grid3{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
    .mrt-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--mrt-line);border-radius:var(--mrt-r);
      padding:28px 24px;text-align:center;transition:transform .3s ease, box-shadow .3s ease}
    .mrt-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 18px 40px -24px rgba(21,42,33,.35)}
    .mrt-card .mrt-emoji{font-size:30px;margin-bottom:12px}
    .mrt-card h3{font-family:var(--mrt-serif);font-weight:500;font-size:20px;margin-bottom:8px}
    .mrt-card p{color:var(--mrt-muted);font-size:14.5px}

    /* ---------- problème / solution ---------- */
    .mrt-prose{max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;font-size:17px;display:grid;gap:14px}
    .mrt-prose strong{color:var(--mrt-gold)}
    .mrt-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:44px;counter-reset:mrtstep}
    @media(max-width:749px){.mrt-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
    .mrt-step{background:rgba(250,246,239,.06);border:1px solid rgba(250,246,239,.14);
      border-radius:var(--mrt-r);padding:26px 22px}
    .mrt-step::before{counter-increment:mrtstep;content:counter(mrtstep,decimal-leading-zero);
      font-family:var(--mrt-serif);font-size:15px;color:var(--mrt-gold);letter-spacing:.1em}
    .mrt-step h3{font-family:var(--mrt-serif);font-weight:500;font-size:19px;margin:8px 0 6px}
    .mrt-step p{font-size:14.5px;color:rgba(250,246,239,.75)}

    /* ---------- timeline ---------- */
    .mrt-tl{max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;gap:0}
    .mrt-tl-item{position:relative;padding:0 0 30px 34px;border-left:1.5px solid var(--mrt-line)}
    .mrt-tl-item:last-child{border-left-color:transparent;padding-bottom:0}
    .mrt-tl-item::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:-7px;top:4px;width:12px;height:12px;
      border-radius:50%;background:var(--mrt-gold);box-shadow:0 0 0 4px var(--mrt-cream)}
    .mrt-alt .mrt-tl-item::before{box-shadow:0 0 0 4px var(--mrt-sand)}
    .mrt-tl-item small{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mrt-gold);font-weight:700}
    .mrt-tl-item h3{font-family:var(--mrt-serif);font-weight:500;font-size:20px;margin:4px 0}
    .mrt-tl-item p{color:var(--mrt-muted);font-size:15px}

    /* ---------- avis ---------- */
    .mrt-review{text-align:left}
    .mrt-stars{color:var(--mrt-gold);letter-spacing:3px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:15px}
    .mrt-review p{font-size:15px;color:var(--mrt-ink)}
    .mrt-review footer{margin-top:14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--mrt-muted)}
    .mrt-review footer b{color:var(--mrt-forest)}

    /* ---------- FAQ ---------- */
    .mrt-faq{max-width:680px;margin:0 auto}
    .mrt-faq details{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--mrt-line);border-radius:var(--mrt-r-sm);
      margin-bottom:10px;overflow:hidden}
    .mrt-faq summary{list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;
      padding:17px 20px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;font-size:15.5px}
    .mrt-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
    .mrt-faq summary::after{content:"+";font-size:20px;color:var(--mrt-gold);transition:transform .3s}
    .mrt-faq details[open] summary::after{transform:rotate(45deg)}
    .mrt-faq .mrt-faq-a{padding:0 20px 17px;color:var(--mrt-muted);font-size:14.5px}

    /* ---------- CTA final ---------- */
    .mrt-final{text-align:center}
    .mrt-final .mrt-btn{width:auto;min-width:280px;background:var(--mrt-gold);color:var(--mrt-forest-deep)}
    .mrt-final .mrt-btn:hover{background:#D4B36F}
    .mrt-final .mrt-h2{color:var(--mrt-cream)}

    /* ---------- sticky bar ---------- */
    .mrt-sticky{position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:60;background:rgba(250,246,239,.96);
      backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-top:1px solid var(--mrt-line);padding:10px 16px;
      transform:translateY(110%);transition:transform .35s ease}
    .mrt-sticky.is-visible{transform:translateY(0)}
    .mrt-sticky-in{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
    .mrt-sticky img{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;object-fit:cover}
    .mrt-sticky-meta{flex:1;min-width:0}
    .mrt-sticky-meta b{display:block;font-size:14px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
    .mrt-sticky-meta span{font-size:13px;color:var(--mrt-muted)}
    .mrt-sticky .mrt-btn{width:auto;padding:13px 26px;font-size:14.5px}
    @media(max-width:559px){.mrt-sticky img{display:none}}

    /* ---------- toast ---------- */
    .mrt-toast{position:fixed;right:20px;bottom:86px;z-index:70;background:var(--mrt-forest);
      color:var(--mrt-cream);border-radius:var(--mrt-r-sm);padding:14px 20px;font-size:14.5px;
      box-shadow:0 18px 40px -18px rgba(21,42,33,.6);opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);
      transition:.35s ease;pointer-events:none}
    .mrt-toast.is-visible{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);pointer-events:auto}
    .mrt-toast a{color:var(--mrt-gold);font-weight:600;text-decoration:underline}

    /* ---------- reveal ---------- */
    .mrt-reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px);transition:opacity .7s ease,transform .7s ease}
    .mrt-reveal.is-in{opacity:1;transform:none}
    @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.mrt-reveal{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:none}}
  </style>

  {%- comment -%} ========== 1. HERO ACHAT ========== {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="mrt-wrap mrt-hero" id="mrt-acheter-{{ uid }}">
    <div class="mrt-gallery">
      <div class="mrt-main-img">
        {%- if product.featured_image -%}
          <img data-mrt-main src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 1100 }}"
               alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | default: product.title | escape }}" width="1100" height="1100">
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
      {%- if product.images.size > 1 -%}
        <div class="mrt-thumbs">
          {%- for image in product.images limit: 8 -%}
            <div class="mrt-thumb{% if forloop.first %} is-active{% endif %}" data-mrt-thumb="{{ image | image_url: width: 1100 }}">
              <img src="{{ image | image_url: width: 160 }}" alt="{{ image.alt | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="160" height="160">
            </div>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    <div class="mrt-buy">
      <p class="mrt-brand">myrootalia · soins naturels</p>
      <h1 class="mrt-title">{{ product.title | escape }}</h1>
      <p class="mrt-pitch"><strong>Le rituel du soir</strong> qui nourrit ton cuir chevelu — pour l'apparence de cheveux plus denses, en 2 minutes par jour.</p>

      <div class="mrt-price-row">
        <span class="mrt-price" data-mrt-price>{{ v0.price | money }}</span>
        <span class="mrt-compare" data-mrt-compare {% unless v0.compare_at_price > v0.price %}hidden{% endunless %}>{{ v0.compare_at_price | money }}</span>
        <span class="mrt-save" data-mrt-save {% unless v0.compare_at_price > v0.price %}hidden{% endunless %}>Économise&nbsp;<span data-mrt-save-amt>{{ v0.compare_at_price | minus: v0.price | money }}</span></span>
      </div>

      {%- unless product.has_only_default_variant -%}
        {%- for option in product.options_with_values -%}
          <p class="mrt-opt-label">{{ option.name | escape }}</p>
          <div class="mrt-opts" data-mrt-option-index="{{ forloop.index0 }}">
            {%- for value in option.values -%}
              <button type="button" class="mrt-opt{% if option.selected_value == value %} is-active{% endif %}" data-mrt-value="{{ value | escape }}">{{ value | escape }}</button>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- endunless -%}

      <div class="mrt-buyrow">
        <div class="mrt-qty">
          <button type="button" data-mrt-qty-minus aria-label="Réduire la quantité">−</button>
          <input type="number" data-mrt-qty value="1" min="1" aria-label="Quantité">
          <button type="button" data-mrt-qty-plus aria-label="Augmenter la quantité">+</button>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="mrt-btn" data-mrt-atc data-mrt-variant="{{ v0.id }}" {% unless v0.available %}disabled{% endunless %}>
          <span class="mrt-spin" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="mrt-btn-label">{% if v0.available %}Commencer ma routine{% else %}Épuisé{% endif %}</span>
        </button>
      </div>
      <p class="mrt-error" data-mrt-error role="alert"></p>

      <div class="mrt-reassure">
        <span>Essai 60 nuits, remboursé</span>
        <span>Livraison offerte dès 50&nbsp;$</span>
        <span>Expédié du Québec</span>
        <span>Paiement sécurisé</span>
      </div>

      <div class="mrt-delivery">
        <span aria-hidden="true">📦</span>
        <span>Commande aujourd'hui, livré entre le <b data-mrt-date-min></b> et le <b data-mrt-date-max></b>.</span>
      </div>

      <div class="mrt-acc">
        <details>
          <summary>Ingrédients &amp; formule</summary>
          <div class="mrt-acc-body">
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Huile de romarin</strong> — l'actif star des routines cuir chevelu sain.</li>
              <li><strong>Huile de ricin</strong> — nourrit et gaine la fibre.</li>
              <li><strong>Biotine</strong> — associée à la force des cheveux.</li>
              <li><strong>Jojoba &amp; argan</strong> — texture légère, absorption rapide.</li>
            </ul>
            <p style="margin-top:10px">Sans sulfates ni parabènes. Parfum naturel léger. Vegan &amp; cruelty-free.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Comment l'utiliser</summary>
          <div class="mrt-acc-body">
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Applique</strong> quelques gouttes sur cuir chevelu propre et sec.</li>
              <li><strong>Masse</strong> 1 à 2 minutes, du front à la nuque.</li>
              <li><strong>Laisse poser</strong> — idéalement le soir. Usage quotidien.</li>
            </ul>
            <p style="margin-top:10px">Les résultats s'installent avec la constance, en 8 à 12 semaines.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Livraison &amp; retours</summary>
          <div class="mrt-acc-body">
            <ul>
              <li>Gratuite au Canada dès 50&nbsp;$, sinon 6,99&nbsp;$.</li>
              <li>Expédié du Québec sous 24 à 48&nbsp;h ouvrées, livré en 3 à 8 jours.</li>
              <li>Essai 60 nuits : tu écris, on rembourse.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </details>
        {%- if product.description != blank -%}
        <details>
          <summary>Description</summary>
          <div class="mrt-acc-body">{{ product.description }}</div>
        </details>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} ========== 2. BANDEAU DÉFILANT ========== {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="mrt-dark mrt-marquee" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="mrt-marquee-track">
      {%- for i in (1..2) -%}
        <span>Essai 60 nuits</span><span>Livraison gratuite dès 50&nbsp;$</span><span>Expédié du Québec</span><span>Actifs naturels</span><span>Support humain sous 24&nbsp;h</span>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} ========== 3. BÉNÉFICES ========== {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="mrt-sec">
    <div class="mrt-wrap">
      <span class="mrt-kicker">Les bénéfices</span>
      <h2 class="mrt-h2">Trois raisons d'en faire ton rituel</h2>
      <p class="mrt-sub">Un geste simple, des actifs naturels, et de la constance.</p>
      <div class="mrt-grid3">
        <div class="mrt-card mrt-reveal"><div class="mrt-emoji">🌿</div><h3>Cuir chevelu sain</h3><p>Apaise et nourrit le cuir chevelu — le sol où tout commence.</p></div>
